[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2518969519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100018#issuecomment-2518969519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100018","id":2518969519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WJGyv","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T02:45:47Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T03:11:48Z","body":"Since the issue description seems to be mixed-up the matters, let's separate them:\n\n---\n\n**1. If there is more than one AnimationTree, each one is misaligned**\n\nThis is not a bug. It is the intended behavior because each AnimationTree is getting a different delta. If you want to process the same fixed delta in all AnimationTrees, set `CallbackModeProcess` to `Physics` and this problem will not occur\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91022576-bef8-46c1-9213-4d251b4ca500)\n\nAlternatively, you can get the delta from the root node of the scene and proceed manually with passing it into `AnimationTree.advance(delta)` and setting `CallbackModeProcess` to `Manual`,\n\n**2. The AnimationTree progression is broken “when opening the AnimationTreeEditor”**\n\nThis is definitely a bug. However, it is a bug only in the editor. Perhaps, as with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/22887, there is a confusion of pointers for what is passed to the editor\n\n---\n\nSo the former is not a bug, only the latter needs to be fixed. And in any case, AnimationNodeTransiton is never relevant.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2518969519/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519214851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100018#issuecomment-2519214851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100018","id":2519214851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WKCsD","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T05:27:59Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T05:32:32Z","body":"~The problem does occur with callback on Physics on all animationtrees, so 1. is also broken~\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3dade1e-9537-44e4-84db-6293c7d60875\n\nEdit: Nvm, seems something went wrong during setting up that messed up the sync internally, restarting the scene and it's not happening anymore.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519214851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519541003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100018#issuecomment-2519541003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100018","id":2519541003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WLSUL","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T08:16:21Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T09:50:47Z","body":"Yes, synchronization loss during setup is also a known problem of the editor, so you can make a separate issue or proposal as an Enhancement; Like detecting a synchronization change and setting the active property of the associated AnimationTree in the scene once to false and then to true again.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2519541003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2520090924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100018#issuecomment-2520090924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100018","id":2520090924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WNYks","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T11:46:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T11:52:22Z","body":"The following MRPs confirm that the latter problem (pointer-confusion) occurs outside the editor.\n\n[at-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18022665/at-bug.zip)\n\nIn conclusion, simply the `backward` flag is not parameterized and each AnimationTree access the same reference. Therefore, this problem should be specific to ping-pong.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2520090924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]